@startuml SEQ_UC04_reporting_dashboards
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #333333
  LifeLineBorderColor #888888
  ParticipantBackgroundColor white
  ParticipantBorderColor #666666
  ActorBackgroundColor white
  ActorBorderColor #333333
  BoxBackgroundColor #F8F8F8
  BoxBorderColor #AAAAAA
  NoteBackgroundColor #FFFFEE
  NoteBorderColor #AAAAAA
}

title SEQ_UC04 - Reporting et Tableaux de Bord (Angular 17)\nKPIs multi-sources -> Spring Boot -> Angular SPA

actor "Directeur\n(web Angular)" as DIR
actor "Analyste Credit\n(web Angular)" as ANA

box "nginx :80"
  participant "Nginx\n(Reverse Proxy + Angular build)" as NGINX
end box

box "Angular SPA (navigateur)"
  participant "Angular Router\n(AuthGuard + RoleGuard)" as ROUTER
  participant "KpiService\n(HttpClient + Interceptor)" as ANG_SVC
  participant "Chart.js\n(graphiques)" as CHART
end box

box "springboot-api :8080"
  participant "JwtAuthFilter\nDirecteurController\nAnalysteController" as SPRING
end box

box "postgres:15 schema dw"
  database "mart_kpi_collecte\nmart_kpi_recouvrement\nmart_benchmarks_agences" as DW
end box

== Authentification et acces ==

DIR -> NGINX : HTTPS GET /dashboard
NGINX -> ROUTER : Sert Angular SPA (index.html)
ROUTER -> ROUTER : AuthGuard - verifie\ncookie imf_access (HttpOnly)
ROUTER --> DIR : Affiche /dashboard (role DIRECTEUR)

== Chargement des KPIs Directeur ==

DIR -> ANG_SVC : ngOnInit() -> fetchKpis()
ANG_SVC -> NGINX : GET /api/v1/directeur/kpis\n?dateDebut=...&agenceId=...\n[Cookie: imf_access auto]
NGINX -> SPRING : Proxy -> springboot:8080

activate SPRING
SPRING -> SPRING : JwtAuthFilter\nvalide cookie, extrait role=DIRECTEUR
SPRING -> DW : SELECT FROM dw.mart_kpi_collecte\nJOIN dw.mart_kpi_recouvrement\nWHERE date_snapshot BETWEEN ? AND ?
DW --> SPRING : agregats par date/agence

SPRING -> DW : SELECT FROM dw.mart_benchmarks_agences\nWHERE date_snapshot = CURRENT_DATE - 1
DW --> SPRING : classement agences

SPRING --> ANG_SVC : 200 OK\n{montantTotal, tauxPAR30, tauxPAR90,\nbenchmarks: [...], trend30j: [...]}
deactivate SPRING

ANG_SVC -> CHART : Render graphiques\n(Line chart PAR30, Bar chart collectes,\nPie chart canaux)
CHART --> DIR : Dashboard affiche

== Filtrage par agence ==

DIR -> ANG_SVC : Selectionne agence dans filtre
ANG_SVC -> NGINX : GET /api/v1/directeur/kpis?agenceId={uid}
note right : Debounce 300ms\nRxJS switchMap

NGINX -> SPRING : Proxy request
SPRING -> DW : SELECT WHERE agence_id = ?
DW --> SPRING : KPIs filtres
SPRING --> ANG_SVC : 200 OK KpiResponse filtre
ANG_SVC -> CHART : Re-render graphiques
CHART --> DIR : Dashboard mis a jour

== Scoring ML par l'Analyste ==

ANA -> ANG_SVC : GET /api/v1/analyste/scoring/{clientId}\n[Cookie: imf_access]
NGINX -> SPRING : Proxy request
SPRING -> DW : SELECT ml.client_scores + ml.shap_explanations
DW --> SPRING : {scoreMcrs, niveauRisque, shap}
SPRING --> ANG_SVC : 200 OK ScoringResponse
ANG_SVC --> ANA : Affiche MCRS + top features SHAP

@enduml
